    "statement": "Matter, radiation and vacuum have respectively third-power, fourth-power and Fold-invariant transport. The terminal late-time law is E2(r)=(11+5r^3)/16; Omega_m(r)=5r^3/(11+5r^3); Omega_v(r)=11/(11+5r^3); matter-vacuum equality is r^3=11/5; acceleration onset is r^3=22/5; and the present accelerating magnitude is 17/32. The static-vacuum correspondence is tension of One magnitude. All quantities are exact positive whole/fractional Fold forms or typed empty/orientation structures.",
